###############################################################################
# SIMBA Care — manual API checks for every action + edge case.
#
# Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (or JetBrains HTTP client):
# click "Send Request" above each block. Switch @baseUrl to your deployed URL
# to test production. Dates use 2026 to stay in the future — adjust as needed.
###############################################################################

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# @baseUrl = https://YOUR-DEPLOYMENT.vercel.app

### Usage doc (GET) — describes the contract
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/voice

### 1. check_availability — slots in a window
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/voice
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "check_availability", "startDate": "2026-06-01", "endDate": "2026-06-05" }

### 1b. EDGE: no availability (weekend) → 200 "unavailable" + next-day alternativeSlots
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/voice
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "check_availability", "startDate": "2026-05-30", "endDate": "2026-05-31" }

### 2. create_booking — naive local time is normalized to clinic tz (America/New_York)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/voice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "create_booking",
  "start": "2026-06-09T10:00:00",
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "number": "7782957462",
  "notes": "Root Canal"
}

### 2b. EDGE: double booking — book the SAME slot again → 200 "conflict"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/voice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "create_booking",
  "start": "2026-06-09T10:00:00",
  "name": "John Smith",
  "email": "john.smith@example.com",
  "number": "7782957462",
  "notes": "Cleaning"
}

### 3. cancel_booking — frees the slot again (replace bookingId with a real uid from step 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/voice
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "cancel_booking", "bookingId": "REPLACE_WITH_UID", "reason": "Patient requested cancellation" }

### 3b. EDGE: cancel a non-existent booking → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/voice
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "cancel_booking", "bookingId": "does-not-exist" }

### 4. EDGE: validation — invalid email → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/voice
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "create_booking", "start": "2026-06-09T10:00:00", "name": "Bad", "email": "not-an-email", "number": "7782957462" }

### 4b. EDGE: validation — unknown action → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/voice
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "frobnicate" }

### 4c. EDGE: validation — endDate before startDate → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/voice
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "check_availability", "startDate": "2026-06-05", "endDate": "2026-06-01" }
